// ============ GLOW ============
// An evidence-based beauty toolkit, not an article library. Every screen gives
// something usable in under thirty seconds; the education sits underneath for
// anyone who wants it.
//
// Product notes: recommendations are by name, with who each one suits. No
// prices, no links, no ASINs — formulations change and products get
// discontinued, so availability is verified at storefront time, not here.
//
// Claim discipline: where evidence is thin, the copy says so. A nurse's brand
// is only worth something if it declines to overstate.

// tiers: b = budget · g = best overall · l = luxury
const P = (b, g, l) => ({ budget: b, best: g, lux: l })

